abstract: >
  SIRIUS LOCAL AI is a fully modular, offline-only AI runtime designed for secure,
  deterministic execution of commands, workflows, plugins, and semantic automation.
  Version 4.0.0 introduces the Intelligent Runtime architecture, including Runtime Core 4.0,
  Plugin System 4.0, Workflow Engine 4.0, Reasoning Engine 4.0, GUI 4.0, AITE 4.0,
  and upgraded household-oriented modules such as HOME_ASSISTANT 4.0, COOKING_ADVISOR 4.0,
  SCHOOL_HELPER 4.0, DEVICE_DIAGNOSTICS 4.0, IMAGE_ANALYZER 4.0, and CONTEXT_ROUTER 4.0.

  This version also includes SECURITY FAMILY 4.0, an identity and family safety layer
  providing OWNER/FAMILY/STRANGER identity levels, time-limits v2 for children,
  safe-mode for unknown users, and a Schoolwork Engine ensuring unrestricted access
  to academic tasks.

  The system operates entirely on the user's machine, without any cloud dependencies
  or external data transmission. All modules follow strict security boundaries,
  deterministic behavior, semantic understanding, and predictable execution rules.

  Version 4.0.0 also introduces the Self-Repair & Health-Check Layer, providing
  integrity checks, safe automatic repairs, and diagnostic capabilities to maintain
  long-term system stability, as well as ENVOY 4.0, an isolated safe online retrieval
  layer for sanitized external information.
